        </summary>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          Yes. Clicking "Download PDF" generates a branded PDF report containing your calculation summary, step-by-step mathematical breakdown, and the comparative tax rate matrix for your selected mode.
        </p>
      </details>

